Package: dfdisk
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libewf-tools, gddrescue, smartmontools, util-linux, udev
Description: Modern forensic disk imaging and conversion CLI/TUI tool
 dfdisk is a high-performance terminal utility designed for DFIR examiners,
 law enforcement investigators, and forensic technicians. It combines
 hardware discovery, system safety guardrails, automated evidence naming,
 dual-hash verification (MD5/SHA1/SHA256), and bi-directional conversion
 between Expert Witness Format (.E01) and RAW images with a Ratatui TUI dashboard.
